    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1662f0d7057beace1880f9d296ea3438.poster.avif?t=1755419997\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1662f0d7057beace1880f9d296ea3438.webm?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1662f0d7057beace1880f9d296ea3438.mp4?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play rounds where you\u2019re either delivering food or stopping the other team from doing it. Swap roles every round\u2014turn up the heat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1a20d7effa774141db2b8d73bee60f51.poster.avif?t=1755419997\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1a20d7effa774141db2b8d73bee60f51.webm?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1a20d7effa774141db2b8d73bee60f51.mp4?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play solo against bots, team up in co-op, or battle online with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1c935f77e8e40540dc32ac25b6c91921.poster.avif?t=1755419997\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1c935f77e8e40540dc32ac25b6c91921.webm?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1c935f77e8e40540dc32ac25b6c91921.mp4?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One round you're a guard, the next a thief. Each battle flips your role and assigns you a random food fighter. Stay sharp\u2014adapt fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/4f57abacb44a9f976d9f20c888eaa3bf.poster.avif?t=1755419997\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/4f57abacb44a9f976d9f20c888eaa3bf.webm?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/4f57abacb44a9f976d9f20c888eaa3bf.mp4?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic mix of wild weapons, fast-paced rounds, and unpredictable food-fueled battles. Add it to your wishlist and join the fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1662f0d7057beace1880f9d296ea3438.poster.avif?t=1755419997\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1662f0d7057beace1880f9d296ea3438.webm?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1662f0d7057beace1880f9d296ea3438.mp4?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play rounds where you\u2019re either delivering food or stopping the other team from doing it. Swap roles every round\u2014turn up the heat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1a20d7effa774141db2b8d73bee60f51.poster.avif?t=1755419997\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1a20d7effa774141db2b8d73bee60f51.webm?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1a20d7effa774141db2b8d73bee60f51.mp4?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Play solo against bots, team up in co-op, or battle online with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1c935f77e8e40540dc32ac25b6c91921.poster.avif?t=1755419997\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1c935f77e8e40540dc32ac25b6c91921.webm?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/1c935f77e8e40540dc32ac25b6c91921.mp4?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One round you're a guard, the next a thief. Each battle flips your role and assigns you a random food fighter. Stay sharp\u2014adapt fast!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/4f57abacb44a9f976d9f20c888eaa3bf.poster.avif?t=1755419997\" width=610 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/4f57abacb44a9f976d9f20c888eaa3bf.webm?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3594680/extras/4f57abacb44a9f976d9f20c888eaa3bf.mp4?t=1755419997\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A chaotic mix of wild weapons, fast-paced rounds, and unpredictable food-fueled battles. Add it to your wishlist and join the fight!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Play as quirky, crazy food characters in this chaotic single or multiplayer action game! Deliver orders as Guards or sabotage as Thieves. Roles switch, weapons change, and madness escalates! Play solo, or in teams with friends in a wacky city full of obstacles, cars and food-fighting mayhem!",
